This project builds and runs NVIDIA Auto Ontology (https://github.com/NVIDIA/auto-ontology),
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. It does not include Auto Ontology's source: the
pinned commit in infra/auto-ontology/UPSTREAM_SHA is cloned at build time into the gitignored
infra/auto-ontology/upstream/.

The files in infra/auto-ontology/patches/ are modifications of that source, applied at build time
and distributed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. Each is a unified diff that names the
upstream files it changes; its file name says what it changes, and the worknote of the issue that
added it (docs/task-management/) says why.
